## Get Contact [GET /api/v1/contacts/contacts/{contactId}]

Retrieve a contact based on the contactId. ContactId is unique.

+ Parameters

    + contactId: `3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6` (String, required) - The unique identifier for a contact
      in UUID format

